: "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_28369212172730796_5258581881626541407_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CS6U8Xjl3yEQ7kNvwERnYZm&_nc_oc=Ado78UoVEWh5il7g0E90mgR_phgH2R2ku5tAamlObP2d67Nn9U3CZVtfQJpYAwUD7o0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMkJl39NeOQsl63UTcEd0wbLpaw28FaUEhCivPZv3K-cA&oe=6ADE0587"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zrx6XHjZwDsQ7kNvwG1pBky&_nc_oc=Adqu-sOGYNRCPBbgsE7MVNMxZc5bCD3JQ9Znvzja9QJ7SnqOVJ5oPIwcBGTOHE7YD3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8pDvqJu1TsRAjGySNh7ea-Xduj0LI1az9uJSQq2jzQw&oe=6ADE0420"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xg9UiJ6aKIoQ7kNvwHzJbC8&_nc_oc=AdoShmAdCcT0Z-mgJCSOciJ9q0HF2Li_YvrwCaleRPE5GoP9tz3NLXf8zaOUXCt5DqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNvsxvfZ7VpE0s0_yjYNI0OX-akmNVPLxfQmpfw6rHieQ&oe=6ADE0DA2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YVCmcGcQ5KQQ7kNvwEmUf2y&_nc_oc=AdqfiDNe9gr2hQnfAwn79D2eceygTnX1zleeCbwSattBWWmQIEkycgUMem0Tnv4YTPE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4HXeNTYV3fosTtXje7B9dh3eDhpYVgKkFc4h4E1iBJw&oe=6ADDFC41"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TD0ArrDPHC0Q7kNvwFqwVhe&_nc_oc=AdqS34Oj6OUSdy6u7pq32jsKx4RIDzzy5XHDHFdpUAY9IYXnCtCNeb1OH5vmbLK-Dxg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO3MwtZLUvhDoeWu0_dh9Hcx8rUdLrgJX3YBBztduoWtQ&oe=6ADE2292"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer